{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1cfee5e12bc62e463c62af7dd2f1ab3c.avif?t=1768688010\" width=1200 height=250 /></span>A short single session game about living with chronic health issues.\u00a0<strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>It\u2019s Not You, It\u2019s M.E. is a short, emotional story you can\u2019t \u201cwin.\u201d</strong><br>Created by a solo developer, it follows one exhausting week where simple tasks, small choices, and normal daily life quietly become overwhelming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>the lived experience of Long Covid and M.E.</strong>, the game offers a grounded, compassionate look at chronic fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a brief (around 10 minutes) point-and-click narrative with small interactions and hidden mini-games that sometimes feel impossible to complete\u2026 because that\u2019s the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1c7d118a5c90cba190f5ee62c044eec6.poster.avif?t=1768688010\" width=250 height=156 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109440/extras/1c7d118a5c90cba190f5ee62c044eec6.webm?t=1768688010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Featuring original music by Jack The Robot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with support from <strong>Disability and Deaf Arts Fest</strong> and <strong>FACT Gallery</strong>, and made possible thanks to public funding from the <strong>National Lottery through Arts Council England</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Every Da